msgid "Adjust how long the camera pan between panels takes in milliseconds."
msgstr "Adjust how long the camera pan between panels takes in milliseconds."

msgid "After each dictionary lookup that used OCR in a zoomed panel, ask whether the word was read correctly. If not, draw the correct word box and type what it actually says. Everything -- including the exact long-press point -- is appended to OCR.debug.session.log for later review. Off by default."
msgstr "After each dictionary lookup that used OCR in a zoomed panel, ask whether the word was read correctly. If not, draw the correct word box and type what it actually says. Everything -- including the exact long-press point -- is appended to OCR.debug.session.log for later review. Off by default."

msgid "Allow touch and hold on text inside zoomed panels to select text and trigger OCR-based dictionary lookups. On by default; turn off if the OCR word detection misfires often on your comics."
msgstr "Allow touch and hold on text inside zoomed panels to select text and trigger OCR-based dictionary lookups. On by default; turn off if the OCR word detection misfires often on your comics."

msgid "Also pan across the boundary between the last panel of a page and the first panel of the next, instead of cutting instantly. Only animates when the adjacent page has already been detected in the background; otherwise the crossing stays an instant cut."
msgstr "Also pan across the boundary between the last panel of a page and the first panel of the next, instead of cutting instantly. Only animates when the adjacent page has already been detected in the background; otherwise the crossing stays an instant cut."

msgid "Always detect panels from a reduced-size page. Quickest, and the only mode that works on pages with a dark background, but it cannot split interlocking panel layouts."
msgstr "Always detect panels from a reduced-size page. Quickest, and the only mode that works on pages with a dark background, but it cannot split interlocking panel layouts."

msgid "Always use KOReader's own panel detector. Slower and unable to find panels on pages with a dark background, but more literal about panel edges. Unavailable in comic mode, where dark backgrounds are common."
msgstr "Always use KOReader's own panel detector. Slower and unable to find panels on pages with a dark background, but more literal about panel edges. Unavailable in comic mode, where dark backgrounds are common."

