msgid "Comic mode only. Split panels that touch edge to edge with no gap between them, using the black stroke the artist drew between them. Off by default: that stroke looks exactly like a horizon, a caption rule or a black band drawn inside a single panel, so this also cuts some whole panels in half. Try it if your comic's panels are being merged together."
msgstr "Comic mode only. Split panels that touch edge to edge with no gap between them, using the black stroke the artist drew between them. Off by default: that stroke looks exactly like a horizon, a caption rule or a black band drawn inside a single panel, so this also cuts some whole panels in half. Try it if your comic's panels are being merged together."

